The project is AGPL-3.0 because its neural CW decoder bundles the DeepCW model, which
is AGPL-3.0. If you run a modified version of this software and let users interact
with it over a network, AGPL section 13 requires you to offer them the corresponding
source. The app links to its source (https://github.com/Dreikor17/TeleRig) everywhere a
user can reach it: the permanent Source button in the top bar (on phones, the user menu's
"Source & license" item, which desktop has too) and the footer of the sign-in and
change-password pages. If you run a modified copy, point those links at your source.

